Subject: [PATCH 11/41] battery

Battery status spoof.
---
 .../blink/renderer/modules/battery/BUILD.gn   |   5 +-
 .../modules/battery/battery_manager.cc        | 112 +++++++++++++++++-
 2 files changed, 112 insertions(+), 5 deletions(-)

